  "content_blocks": [
    {
      "block_id": "b00000",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Economic operators",
      "ordinal": 0,
      "heading_path": [
        "Economic operators"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00001",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "In: Define > Assess the market",
      "ordinal": 1,
      "heading_path": [
        "Economic operators"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00002",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Overview",
      "ordinal": 2,
      "heading_path": [
        "Economic operators",
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00003",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "This regulation provides that, in the case of certain public contracts, suppliers (i.e. economic operators) may be required to indicate the names and professional qualifications (where relevant) of staff who will be responsible for the performance of the contract in the tender or the request to participate.",
      "ordinal": 3,
      "heading_path": [
        "Economic operators",
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00004",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Regulation 19 also provides that groups of suppliers can participate in a procurement procedure and shall not be required to have a specific legal form (such as a special purpose vehicle, for example) in order to submit a tender or a request to participate.",
      "ordinal": 4,
      "heading_path": [
        "Economic operators",
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00005",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Contracting authorities can specify in the procurement documents how such groups are to meet the selection requirements of the procurement, provided that this is proportionate.",
      "ordinal": 5,
      "heading_path": [
        "Economic operators",
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00006",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Where a group of suppliers is awarded a contract, contracting authorities may, where it is necessary for satisfactory performance of the contract, require that the group assume a specific legal form (such as a special purpose vehicle, for example).",
      "ordinal": 6,
      "heading_path": [
        "Economic operators",
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00007",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Objective at this commercial stage",
      "ordinal": 7,
      "heading_path": [
        "Economic operators",
        "Objective at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00008",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "It is prohibited to exclude from a regulated procurement process any supplier(s) that does not assume a specific legal form (e.g. whether participating as a group of suppliers or participating in an individual capacity). Contracting authorities may nonetheless require groups of suppliers to assume a specific legal form once they have been awarded a contract, where necessary for the satisfactory performance of the contract.",
      "ordinal": 8,
      "heading_path": [
        "Economic operators",
        "Objective at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00009",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Key considerations at this commercial stage",
      "ordinal": 9,
      "heading_path": [
        "Economic operators",
        "Key considerations at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00010",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Contracting authorities should:",
      "ordinal": 10,
      "heading_path": [
        "Economic operators",
        "Key considerations at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00011",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "consider whether suppliers will be required to provide the names and relevant professional qualifications of the staff responsible for the performance of a contract",
      "ordinal": 11,
      "heading_path": [
        "Economic operators",
        "Key considerations at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00012",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "ensure suppliers (whether responding as a group or individually) are treated fairly throughout the procurement process.",
      "ordinal": 12,
      "heading_path": [
        "Economic operators",
        "Key considerations at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00013",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Legal framework",
      "ordinal": 13,
      "heading_path": [
        "Economic operators",
        "Legal framework"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00014",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "See also in the Procurement Act 2023:",
      "ordinal": 14,
      "heading_path": [
        "Economic operators",
        "Legal framework"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00015",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "Section 22: Conditions of participation",
      "ordinal": 15,
      "heading_path": [
        "Economic operators",
        "Legal framework"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
